{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"lines\":[{\"sec\":\"S01\",\"idx\":1,\"text\":\"可心里很快空了，想继续往前走，却不知靠什么安定下来。\",\"keys\":[\"继续往前走\",\"安定下来\"]},{\"sec\":\"S04\",\"idx\":1,\"text\":\"那些委屈让他拿不准离开对不对，也想不出当初没走会怎样。\",\"keys\":[\"那些委屈\",\"没走会怎样\"]},{\"sec\":\"S05\",\"idx\":0,\"text\":\"他仍不服气，觉得当初受的那些气不该忍。\",\"keys\":[\"不服气\",\"受的那些气\"]},{\"sec\":\"S05\",\"idx\":1,\"text\":\"他不想忘掉开心的过去，想到自己离开了他们，心里还难受。\",\"keys\":[\"开心的过去\",\"离开了他们\"]},{\"sec\":\"S06\",\"idx\":1,\"text\":\"他想再遇到这样的默契，又怕再也遇不到；可想到自己曾拥有过，心里暖了一点。\",\"keys\":[\"这样的默契\",\"暖了一点\"]},{\"sec\":\"S07\",\"idx\":0,\"text\":\"他没料到离开后这么孤单，难事还得自己扛，撑得住吗？\",\"keys\":[\"难事还得自己扛\",\"撑得住吗\"]},{\"sec\":\"S07\",\"idx\":1,\"text\":\"他想找回从前那份亲近，可想到还得受气，早知道这样还会走吗？\",\"keys\":[\"从前那份亲近\",\"早知道这样\"]},{\"sec\":\"S08\",\"idx\":0,\"text\":\"他先把回去的事放一边，只回想从前和他们相处的日子。\",\"keys\":[\"回去的事放一边\",\"相处的日子\"]},{\"sec\":\"S08\",\"idx\":1,\"text\":\"回忆不能陪他过难关，心又很快悬了起来。\",\"keys\":[\"回忆不能陪他过难关\",\"悬了起来\"]},{\"sec\":\"S09\",\"idx\":0,\"text\":\"他分不清，想回去是舍不得那份亲近，还是怕孤单。\",\"keys\":[\"那份亲近\",\"怕孤单\"]},{\"sec\":\"S11\",\"idx\":0,\"text\":\"他明知回去未必找回那份亲近，却还是忍不住盼一盼。\",\"keys\":[\"那份亲近\",\"忍不住盼一盼\"]},{\"sec\":\"S11\",\"idx\":1,\"text\":\"他不愿只凭这点盼头就回头，先把眼下的日子过稳，害怕也不往回退。\",\"keys\":[\"这点盼头\",\"眼下的日子过稳\",\"不往回退\"]},{\"sec\":\"S12\",\"idx\":0,\"text\":\"他承认受过气，也承认从前开心过，不再逼自己只记住其中一面。\",\"keys\":[\"受过气\",\"开心过\",\"其中一面\"]},{\"sec\":\"S13\",\"idx\":1,\"text\":\"他想好好生活，盼再遇见亲近的人；即使没有，也不再为留住谁而咽下委屈。\",\"keys\":[\"好好生活\",\"亲近的人\",\"咽下委屈\"]}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "169a45f1-f9f8-401b-a3d1-ebfac3032c9c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T154115853056Z", "elapsed_seconds": 604.219, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T15:51:20.076970+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b1fe527bb450919e33f6ea228ed303bdc5905cf2fc520e8618f5b09d9e99b4d7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T154115853056Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "70bb0fe825d3c30b702e88c52f2cc14249180d081581bfafcddd39709cc44b98"}}}
